---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Riverside & Raft House Khao Sok Lake Package"
  description="3 Day Raft House Khao Sok Package - 1 night at Riverside Cottages & 1 night at the khao Sok national park raft houses"
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/GrandAdventure_Package_RiverExterior_MG_8124.jpg"
  heroTitle="Riverside & Raft House Khao Sok Lake Package"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Lake Package River ...", "href": "/khao-sok-lake-package-river-raft/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Riverside & Raft House Khao Sok 3 day package</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>3 days, 2 nights Khao Sok Raft House Package with 1 night at Riverside Cottages and 1 night at one of the Khao Sok national park raft houses</strong>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Day 1 – Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Your package begins at Riverside Cottages, where you'll check in and then be shown to your room. In the afternoon, explore the river by <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">canoe</a> or alternatively have a relaxing one hour Thai massage. In the evening, dinner is included in the package (as are all other meals). Spend the night at Riverside Cottages.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Day 2 – Khao Sok national park raft houses</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Enjoy a full breakfast and then go on an overnight trip to <a href="/cheow-lan-lake-information-guide/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan</a> Lake. Join with a guide and a group of 10-18 other guests and take a boat ride through incredible scenery to a floating restaurant where you will have lunch. In the afternoon, head into the jungle for a hike, or take it easy and go for a swim in the emerald waters of the lake. After a fresh dinner (included), spend the night in a floating raft house.<strong> Please note that they are very rustic, and there is a shared bathroom (private bathrooms are not available).</strong>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Day 3 – Early Mist Safari</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Continue your Khao Sok raft house tour with an early morning mist safari; look for giant hornbills, monkeys, and gibbons feeding in the trees before breakfast. Depart the raft house, and enjoy the boat ride back to the pier. The tour ends at 11:00 at Rajapraba dam (with a pack lunch), or at 12:00 at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages (with lunch of fried rice).
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>1 night at Riverside Cottages, and 1 night in a Khao Sok raft house at <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Lake</a>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Does not include entrance fee to <a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok National Park</a><strong>.</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>This Khao Sok Lake Package includes dinner on Day 1, all meals on Day 2, and breakfast + lunch on Day 3.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
